         override the extension id and how long to wait for the extension to open its own tab).
What:    waits for the extension's context, uses the tab the extension opened on the URL's host (the Claude
         extension opens https://claude.ai/oauth/authorize… → /login by itself) or opens the URL, selects it, then
         runs <out dir>/step-N.js in the page world of that tab as the files appear (argument `extensionId`), writing
         step-N.out. popup-after-step-N.js, when present, runs in the extension's popup.html (a bare web view on the
         context's configuration). Nothing is typed or clicked in the page by the harness itself.
