         (python3 -m http.server 18326 --bind 127.0.0.1 -d TestExtensions/api-explorer/external-page) and launch with
         HARNESS_EXT=<seeded id> OWN_TAB_WAIT=0 and url http://127.0.0.1:18326/index.html?id=<seeded id>.
Output:  <out dir>/harness.log, step-N.out, app-log.txt
