         and registered content scripts run on the loopback page), serve external-page/ on 127.0.0.1:18326, then
           MODE=explorer CS_EXT=<cs-fixture id> HARNESS_EXT=<api-explorer id> OWN_TAB_WAIT=0 \
             .claude/scratch/task132.6/drive.sh launch <data dir> <out dir> "http://127.0.0.1:18326/index.html?id=<api-explorer id>"
         and wait for DONE in harness.log. Clicks are mouse-down/up NSEvents handed to the web view's own handlers
         (the app stays inactive); elements are brought into view by script. It clicks the page's buttons, opens the
         API Explorer popup through ExtensionPopoverController.show and clicks Show Received / Clear, then calls
         ExtensionManager.setEnabled(id:enabled:) (what the Settings switch calls) off and on, checking the open
         page, a page loaded while disabled, and the cs-fixture content scripts each time. PNG per step.

